/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * wv_mshtml.inl - the old MSHTML / Internet Explorer backend
 *
 * Only used on Windows 7 and older, or when the backend policy asks for it.
 * This is plain OLE embedding: a client site, an in-place site, a frame, a
 * document host UI handler and a security manager, all hand written vtables.
 *
 * Included by webview.h. Not meant to be compiled on its own.
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

